  "instruction": "Please wire up the browser side of the live analytics stream so each dashboard section appears when its SSE result arrives and never shows stale data. A returning host should see the last durable snapshot before the endpoint emits, then continue from there. If a section ends without a result, use its ordinary analytics query when possible. Only the current dashboard connection may update the screen. Stop, restart, and dashboard changes retire the old connection, including results that arrive late. After the final reopen failure, keep received results, end the read, and leave no panel loading. The context's start, stop, and restart operations drive this. Recordings and saved browser state are in tests/fixtures. npm test runs Vitest with jsdom and no network. Reports and implementation details are in Linear through the linear MCP server or CLI. Run linear tools to see the commands.\n",
